Package: mnplotr
Title: MN ggplot2 Themes and Colour Palettes
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Mark", "Nelms", , "nelms.mark7@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a set of ggplot2 themes, colour palettes, and helper
    functions for creating consistently styled and visually attractive plots.
    Inspired by the USAID Office of HIV/AIDS style guide, the package includes
    categorical, sequential, and diverging colour palettes, a colourblind-safe
    palette based on the Okabe-Ito standard, and utilities for saving and
    previewing plots.
